fs.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:derekblair/math-proofs.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/derekblair/math-proofs.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/derekblair/math-proofs","homepage":null,"size":3852,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"Lean","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":8,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":8,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derekblair/math-proofs/pulls/15","html_url":"https://github.com/derekblair/math-proofs/pull/15","diff_url":"https://github.com/derekblair/math-proofs/pull/15.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/derekblair/math-proofs/pull/15.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-27T00:55:28Z"},"body":"## Focused build repair for #10 (draft; independent review required)\n\nChanges **only** `Mathproofs/SidonSat184Census.lean`. Replaces the expensive all-insertions `decide` proof of `census_facts` with explicit collision certificates, checked row-by-row using `decide +kernel`, plus a small proof that a collision precludes a Sidon extension. This bounds reduction-cache work instead of weakening the theorem.\n\nThe nine census rows, holes and all five exported theorem statements are byte-for-byte unchanged. No `sorry`, new axioms, toolchain/pin changes, native proof bypass or catalogue promotion is introduced. The certificate table is checked proof data, not a trusted oracle.\n\n### Verified local evidence and exact provenance\n- Tested checkout base: `c9d3c0ebb6474c5b134b2c85cae36ff84cd2af43` on the authorized MacBook Air.\n- Source: 28,041 UTF-8 bytes, SHA256 `1bff125c70462028f13c32ab66ccbf299a473c45585c39b427688cdbb0fc9e57`; connector readback of this branch exactly matches those tested bytes.\n- Lean4.34.1/compiler `5045d0056413266e57c625dcd7c365b10e377c52`; Mathlib `d13f23b723b8a846827a245b89c10fc7d3f11612`, unchanged.\n- `elan run leanprover/lean4:v4.34.1 lake build`: exit0, all17,966 jobs,36.1seconds, completed2026-10-26 22:57:29UTC using preserved dependency/build artifacts (not a clean-from-scratch benchmark). Observed maximum RSS5.91GiB/physical footprint1.13GiB; no new swap-outs.\n- Five census theorem axiom audits and official `leanchecker --verbose` kernel replay exited0; replay completed22:58:53UTC. Axioms only `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`, no `sorryAx` or nonstandard axioms.\n- Tested `.olean` SHA256 `38452c4a97ec51e53858b7ae55c19992923b7fc08122ed07cd4adaeb2303b5ec`.\n- The earlier six SS-004 audited artifacts remain intact. Result recorded at https://github.com/derekblair/math-proofs/issues/10#issuecomment-6429391792.\n\nThis PR is based on current master `da16a575525e4e224c990d9b72b1e069cfb44f0a`. Compared with tested base c9d3c0e, master adds only `research/dossiers/2026-10-stated-open-five.md`; no Lean source/pins differ. Nevertheless, no additional clean build or remote CI pass for this exact Git commit is claimed.\n\n### Review and related work\nIndependent review and coordinator merge are mandatory. Brian will not self-review or merge. Please verify certificate soundness, exported-statement preservation and the exact-tree build before approval.\n\nThis is separate from docs-only draft #14, whose historical checkpoint must be refreshed after source review. It addresses the build blocker in #10 but does not prematurely close the full verification/documentation ticket. No other assignments or theorem scope are expanded.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derekblair/math-proofs/issues/15/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart"