8: - Tested checkout base: `c9d3c0ebb6474c5b134b2c85cae36ff84cd2af43` on the authorized MacBook Air.
9: - Source: 28,041 UTF-8 bytes, SHA256 `1bff125c70462028f13c32ab66ccbf299a473c45585c39b427688cdbb0fc9e57`; connector readback of this branch exactly matches those tested bytes.
