11: - `elan run leanprover/lean4:v4.34.1 lake build`: exit0, all17,966 jobs,36.1seconds, completed2026-10-26 22:57:29UTC using preserved dependency/build artifacts (not a clean-from-scratch benchmark). Observed maximum RSS5.91GiB/physical footprint1.13GiB; no new swap-outs.
12: - Five census theorem axiom audits and official `leanchecker --verbose` kernel replay exited0; replay completed22:58:53UTC. Axioms only `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`, no `sorryAx` or nonstandard axioms.
13: - Tested `.olean` SHA256 `38452c4a97ec51e53858b7ae55c19992923b7fc08122ed07cd4adaeb2303b5ec`.
14: - The earlier six SS-004 audited artifacts remain intact. Result recorded at https://github.com/derekblair/math-proofs/issues/10#issuecomment-6429391792.
15: 
16: This PR is based on current master `da16a575525e4e224c990d9b72b1e069cfb44f0a`. Compared with tested base c9d3c0e, master adds only `research/dossiers/2026-10-stated-open-five.md`; no Lean source/pins differ. Nevertheless, no additional clean build or remote CI pass for this exact Git commit is claimed.
17: 
18: ### Review and related work
19: Independent review and coordinator merge are mandatory. Brian will not self-review or merge. Please verify certificate soundness, exported-statement preservation and the exact-tree build before approval.
20: 
21: This is separate from docs-only draft #14, whose historical checkpoint must be refreshed after source review. It addresses the build blocker in #10 but does not prematurely close the full verification/documentation ticket. No other assignments or theorem scope are expanded.
